# Security Rules

- Validate and sanitize external input in validators before services run.
- Never use `eval` or dynamic `Function` on request data.
- Do not construct shell commands from user-controlled strings.
- Block path traversal in any ID or filename used for storage paths.
- No hardcoded API keys or tokens; use `.env` locally (never commit `.env`).
